{
  "name": "TestRunEnforcesTimeout",
  "comment": "Discover a fixture that sleeps 30 seconds, run it with test's setting timeoutSeconds=1.\nThe fixture must come back with Status=Timeout — proves test.run cancels\nthe child via CancellationToken and maps the cancellation to TestStatus.Timeout\nrather than hanging the parent.",
